+- I06: Read `../TASK.md` and the implementer skill; ticket is #126 under spec #121.
+- I07: No `GLOSSARY.md` exists; read `CONTEXT.md` and updated its Expected-set entry definition to match the retired field.
+- I08: Read `docs/adr/0045-expected-set-entry-resolves-its-skill-files.md` (advisory, historical ADR left untouched) and the ADR-0044 context it supersedes.
